   "source": [
    "## ✅ Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "### Authentication Methods:\n",
    "\n",
    "**1. API Keys**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Simple and effective\n",
    "api_key_header = APIKeyHeader(name=\"X-API-Key\")\n",
    "\n",
    "@app.get(\"/protected\")\n",
    "async def protected(api_key: str = Security(api_key_header)):\n",
    "    verify_api_key(api_key)\n",
    "    return {\"data\": \"...\"}\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ Use for:\n",
    "  - Machine-to-machine\n",
    "  - Simple APIs\n",
    "  - Server-side apps\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**2. JWT Tokens**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Stateless authentication\n",
    "token = jwt.encode(\n",
    "    {\"sub\": username, \"exp\": expires},\n",
    "    SECRET_KEY\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ Use for:\n",
    "  - User authentication\n",
    "  - Mobile apps\n",
    "  - SPAs\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**3. OAuth2**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Industry standard\n",
    "oauth2_scheme = OAuth2PasswordBearer(\n",
    "    tokenUrl=\"token\",\n",
    "    scopes={...}\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ Use for:\n",
    "  - Third-party access\n",
    "  - Social login\n",
    "  - Fine-grained permissions\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Security Checklist:\n",
    "\n",
    "**✅ Secrets Management:**\n",
    "- Use environment variables\n",
    "- Never commit secrets\n",
    "- Rotate keys regularly\n",
    "- Use secrets manager in production\n",
    "\n",
    "**✅ Token Security:**\n",
    "- Set expiration times\n",
    "- Use strong algorithms (HS256, RS256)\n",
    "- Implement token refresh\n",
    "- Revoke compromised tokens\n",
    "\n",
    "**✅ Password Security:**\n",
    "- Hash with bcrypt\n",
    "- Never store plain text\n",
    "- Enforce strong passwords\n",
    "- Rate limit login attempts\n",
    "\n",
    "**✅ Transport Security:**\n",
    "- Always use HTTPS\n",
    "- Set security headers\n",
    "- Configure CORS properly\n",
    "\n",
    "**✅ Access Control:**\n",
    "- Implement RBAC\n",
    "- Use scopes for permissions\n",
    "- Validate all inputs\n",
    "- Log auth events\n",
    "\n",
    "### Common Patterns:\n",
    "\n",
    "**API Key + Rate Limiting:**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "@app.post(\"/api/chat\")\n",
    "@limiter.limit(\"100/hour\")\n",
    "async def chat(\n",
    "    request: Request,\n",
    "    api_key: str = Security(api_key_header)\n",
    "):\n",
    "    user = verify_api_key(api_key)\n",
    "    # Process request\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**JWT + Refresh Tokens:**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Short-lived access token\n",
    "access_token = create_token(expires=timedelta(hours=1))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Long-lived refresh token\n",
    "refresh_token = create_token(expires=timedelta(days=30))\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Multi-Factor Auth:**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# 1. Username/password\n",
    "# 2. OTP code\n",
    "# 3. Issue token\n",
    "```\n",
